@IF
.
=IF
.
.A block, with any number of ELSEIF parts and one ELSE. THEN is optional at
.the end of the line. ENDIF can be written END IF.
.
:DIM N AS UWORD
:IF N = 0
:  PRINT "NONE"
:ELSEIF N < 10 THEN
:  PRINT "A FEW"
:ELSE
:  PRINT "MANY"
:ENDIF
.
.On one line, with THEN and one statement. A one-line IF has no ELSE.
.
:IF K = 27 THEN PRINT "ESC"
:IF K = 13 THEN EXIT DO
:IF N > 100 GOTO DONE
